# HomerScribe .gitignore
#
# What is here belongs in the repository; what is listed below does not.

# Generated by the build from version.txt. Regenerated every time, so keeping
# it would only ever cause conflicts.
Version.cs

# Downloaded by the build, and far too large for a repository.
ffmpeg.exe
ffprobe.exe
ffplay.exe
yt-dlp.exe
youtube-dl.exe

# Logs, from the build, from runs, and from the repository script.
*.log

# Left behind only if the build is interrupted mid-check.
*.lockcheck

# Maintainer tools, not part of what is distributed.
tagRelease.*
createHomerScribeRepo.cmd
createHomerScribeRepo.ps1

# Announcement drafts for social media and mailing lists. These are written for
# posting elsewhere and have no business in the source of the program.
# Announce.md and Announce.htm are NOT here: they ship with the program and are
# listed in HomerScribe_setup.iss.
Facebook.md
Facebook.docx
LinkedIn.md
LinkedIn.docx
devs.md
devs.docx
*.docx

# Working files from runs.
work/
described.*
transcribed.*
scribed.*

# Windows leavings.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
